cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Harpd Product Discovery Index"
abstract: >-
  Non-sponsored coverage dataset of software, AI and developer products discovered on
  public launch and directory sources, each enriched from its own homepage. Coverage,
  not quality: it records what exists and what can be verified, never a rating.
authors:
  - name: "Harpd"
    website: "https://harpd.com/"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/harpd-dev/harpd-discovery-dataset"
keywords:
  - product discovery
  - ai tools
  - developer tools
  - dataset
  - coverage
